    '_csrf' => 'WVouZVRvdWguF3kmAQMjJDBtaxMALUEeD2geHBs8MwwJO3gGHRUlHA=='
    'Content' => [
        'Title' => 'About Us'
        'Description' => '<p><strong>About Us</strong></p>

<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode,lucida grande,sans-serif\">Konnexions Broadcast Pvt Ltd, the media division of the Konnexions Group, is proud to launch Power Sportz, as Indias first Sports infotainment channel, live 24x7, on a digital platform</span></span></p>

<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode,lucida grande,sans-serif\">Ms Kanthi D Suresh is a Director of the Konnexions group and is also operating in the capacity of the Editor-in-Chief, of Power Sportz. She has been associated with the Sports media for over a decade and has anchored the Olympics, Commonwealth games and Asian games, for India, apart from all the other Sports shows, that she has been involved with.</span></span></p>

<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://uploadedvideo.s3.amazonaws.com/Content/content_96E3C9AD.png\" style=\"height:401px; width:601px\" /></p>

<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode,lucida grande,sans-serif\"><em>&lsquo;<span style=\"color:#800000\"><strong>Voice of Sport&rsquo;</strong></span></em><span style=\"color:#800000\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span>, the tag-line of Power Sportz, &nbsp;clearly depicts and emphasizes the vision of the channel, bringing to light the fact that India with a population of over a billion people, having close to &nbsp;a &nbsp;thousand broadcast channels, does not have a channel dedicated to discuss &amp; debate sports and issues governing sport in India.</span></span></p>

<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode,lucida grande,sans-serif\">The studio, headquartered in Gurgaon, NCR, is equipped with state-of-the-art technology, and is technically distinguished with the latest in the field of broadcast and Information Technology.</span></span></p>

<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode,lucida grande,sans-serif\">Reporters spread across the country work round the clock to bring in news and highlight &nbsp;factual and ground realities of the way sport exists and sport happens in different parts of India</span></span></p>

<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode,lucida grande,sans-serif\">Kanthi, along with her passionate team, coming from the best in the media and sports industry, wishes to provide a platform for the Athlete and the sports lover, through the channel. A voice that should be heard and resonate in the minds of the people and evoke a &nbsp;new kind of a sports imagination in India!</span></span></p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode,lucida grande,sans-serif\">Power Sportz</span></span></p>

<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:lucida sans unicode,lucida grande,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\">The Voice of Sport!</span></span></span></p>
'
        'Status' => '2'
    ]
]

